1
00:00:01,430 --> 00:00:02,900
She's crawling! Emma's crawling!
她在爬！艾□在爬了！

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:05,620
He's bleeding! Joey's bleeding!
他在流血！喬伊在流血了！

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,170
I'm sorry. You've gotta see this. I'm gonna go get Monica and Chandler.
對不起，但你一定要來看 我去找摩妮卡跟錢德

4
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,100
Monica! Chandler!
摩妮卡！錢德！

5
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:15,240
Come over! Come over! Hurry up! Hurry up! Hurry up!
過來！過來！快點、快點、快點！

6
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,510
What? What?
怎樣？什麼事？

7
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:22,540
- Shaving? - No, rabies.
-刮鬍子嗎？ -不，狂犬病

8
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:26,890
- What's going on? - It's Emma. She's crawling.
-是怎麼回事？ -是艾□，她會爬了

9
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:32,390
Wow, look at her go.
哇，瞧瞧她

10
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:35,050
Give her a second.
給她一點時間

11
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:40,862
-Joey, Joey. -Oh, sorry.
-喬伊，喬伊 -哦，對不起

12
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:46,400
I can't believe how fast she's growing up. It seems like only yesterday she was..
我真不敢相信她長的好快 好像昨天她才…

13
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:48,300
farting on my lap.
在我腿上放屁

14
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:51,450
Not so funny when someone does that to you, is it?
有人對你那樣做的時候 並不好笑吧？

15
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:55,380
Emma, come on. Show everybody how you were crawling.
艾□，來吧，讓大家看看你會爬了

16
00:00:55,588 --> 00:00:59,524
Come on, Emma. 
-艾□，來吧 -爬呀，艾□

17
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:03,950
I think we're distracting her. Let's everybody be still for a minute.
我想我們讓她分心了 大家先一分鐘不要動

18
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:21,970
Who's painting us?
誰在畫我們呢？

19
00:01:23,716 --> 00:01:25,877
The One With The Boob Job

00:01:26,716 --> 00:01:27,877
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

20
00:02:00,650 --> 00:02:03,140
Have you seen our bank statement? Can this be right?
你有看過我們的銀行對帳單了嗎？ 沒錯嗎？

21
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:07,080
I know. God, I haven't seen my savings take a hit like this..
就是嘛，天啊 我的存款就沒這麼少過…

22
00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:11,820
since I was a kid and they came up with Double Stuf Oreos.
自從我小時候雙層夾心餅上市之後

23
00:02:11,990 --> 00:02:15,860
- What happened to all of our money? - I'm not sure exactly what they did..
-我們的錢跑哪去了呢？ -我不清楚他們做了什麼…

24
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:18,660
but I'm inclined to blame Enron.
但是我傾向於責怪恩隆案

25
00:02:20,070 --> 00:02:24,230
With you doing the internship, we're spending more than we're bringing in.
因為你在做實習工作 我們花的比賺的還多

26
00:02:25,270 --> 00:02:29,000
Yeah, maybe I should quit and get a job that pays.
是啊，或許我應該辭掉 然後找個有薪水的工作

27
00:02:29,210 --> 00:02:31,770
But you're finally doing something that you love.
但是你終於找到你喜歡的工作了

28
00:02:31,980 --> 00:02:34,380
I mean, I can't ask you to give that up.
我是說，我不能要求你放棄的

29
00:02:34,550 --> 00:02:39,710
Although it would be nice if the thing that you loved was finding gold.
不過如果你喜歡做的事 是尋寶，那會好多了

30
00:02:39,890 --> 00:02:42,620
You know, I think we're making too big a deal out of this.
我覺得我們太小題大作了

31
00:02:42,790 --> 00:02:46,730
We'll pay our bills late this month. Next month we'll cut back on a few things.
我們這個月會比較緊 下個月我們就節省一些開銷

32
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:51,130
And maybe we start eating out of Joey's refrigerator for a change.
而且或許我們可以改變一下 到喬伊家的冰箱找食物

33
00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:55,430
You're a chef. What can you make out of baking soda and beer?
你是廚師 你可以用蘇打粉跟啤酒做出什麼呢？

34
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:58,610
Worst-case scenario is, we borrow some money from my parents.
最糟糕的情況下，我們只好我父母借錢

35
00:02:59,710 --> 00:03:04,010
Or, you slipped on ice at their house last month. Can we sue them?
或者，你上個月在他們家溜冰滑倒 我們可以告他們嗎？

36
00:03:05,610 --> 00:03:07,810
No, and we're not borrowing money.
不可以，而且我們也不借錢

37
00:03:07,980 --> 00:03:10,950
- Why not? - We don't do that. We are Bings.
-為什麼不行？ -我們不能那樣做，我們是賓家的人

38
00:03:13,050 --> 00:03:15,650
If there's one thing my father taught me, it was..
我爸有教過我

39
00:03:15,820 --> 00:03:20,620
well, to always knock before going into the pool house.
在進入撞球間時一定要先敲門

40
00:03:20,830 --> 00:03:25,530
- The other thing is, never borrow money. - I had no idea you had this much pride.
-還有，永遠都不要借錢 -我不知道你是如此有榮譽感

41
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:29,530
That's right, I do. I am your man. I'm gonna get us through this situation..
沒錯，我就是，我是你男人 我會讓我們度過難關的

42
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:33,270
even if it means you working twice as hard.
就算要你加倍努力工作也是

43
00:03:38,610 --> 00:03:40,810
You know, it's just really weird.
你知道嗎？真的是很奇怪

44
00:03:40,980 --> 00:03:45,420
You don't like eating animals, but you love watching them tear each other apart.
你不喜歡吃動物 卻喜歡看他們彼此廝殺

45
00:03:45,590 --> 00:03:48,950
No, I don't.. Get him. Get him!
不，我不喜歡…抓住他，抓他！

46
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:52,320
Separate the sick one from the herd!
把病倒的那個從群體隔開！

47
00:03:52,830 --> 00:03:54,890
- I'm gonna go. - Why?
-我要回去了 -為什麼？

48
00:03:55,130 --> 00:03:58,030
I haven't been home in days, and I need to get more clothes.
我有好幾天沒有回家了 而且我需要多拿幾件衣服

49
00:03:58,230 --> 00:04:01,030
You don't have to go. I have something that'll fit you.
你不用回去，我有衣服可以給你穿

50
00:04:02,140 --> 00:04:05,330
I put that tube top on as a joke.
我穿女生的緊身衣是為了要好笑

51
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:09,100
- I want you to stay. - I want to stay too.
-我想要你留下來 -我也想要留下來

52
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,870
But I've got as much use out of these boxers as I can.
但是我已經不能再穿這幾件內褲了

53
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:14,250
- Why don't you turn them inside.. - Done it.
-為什麼不反過來再穿呢？ -已經反過了

54
00:04:15,950 --> 00:04:19,040
- I'll be back in a couple of hours. - All right. I'll miss you.
-我幾個小時之後就回來 -好吧，我會想你的

55
00:04:19,250 --> 00:04:21,450
Me too.
我也是

56
00:04:22,820 --> 00:04:25,220
Oh, fine. Yeah, you got away.
喔，好啦，你是逃走了

57
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:28,420
But don't look so smug. You're gonna bleed to death.
但是不要太沾沾自喜 你會失血過多而死的

58
00:04:29,630 --> 00:04:33,230
You know what? I just realized something. I don't want to go home.
你知道嗎？我剛驚覺到一件事 我不想要回家

59
00:04:33,430 --> 00:04:37,730
- Great! Okay, I'll go get the tube top. - No, no, what I mean is..
-太好了，好的，我去拿緊身衣 -不，我的意思是…

60
00:04:37,910 --> 00:04:40,740
I hate going back to my apartment now.
我不喜歡回去自己的公寓

61
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:45,110
Partly because I live above a known crack den..
一方面是因為我住在 一間髒亂的小房間上面

62
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:48,480
but, you know, mostly because when I'm there, I really miss you.
但是，主要是因為我回去的時候 我真的好想你

63
00:04:50,250 --> 00:04:52,480
So..
所以…

64
00:04:53,090 --> 00:04:55,890
do you want to move in together?
我們一起住好不好？

65
00:04:56,590 --> 00:04:59,060
Wow, Mike Hanigan..
哇，麥克漢尼根

66
00:04:59,230 --> 00:05:02,420
you sure know how to make a girl say "Hell, yeah."
你倒是挺清楚要如何 讓女生說「好！」

67
00:05:03,060 --> 00:05:06,630
- So we're doing it? - Yeah, let's do it. Let's live together.
-那我們要這樣做嗎？ -好啊，就這樣做，我們一起住

68
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:11,370
- We're really gonna move in together? - Yeah.
-我們真的要同居嗎？ -是啊

69
00:05:11,940 --> 00:05:15,840
I've always wanted to live with a guy.
我一直都想要跟男生同居

70
00:05:16,010 --> 00:05:18,770
Pick up your socks. Put down the toilet seat.
襪子撿起來，馬桶坐墊放下來

71
00:05:18,950 --> 00:05:22,580
No, we are not having sex anymore.
不，我再也不跟你做愛了

72
00:05:22,750 --> 00:05:25,410
It's gonna be fun.
一定會很好玩

73
00:05:28,860 --> 00:05:30,650
Shame on you, TV Guide.
真討厭《電視指南》

74
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:33,620
A man's ass is not nudity!
男人的屁股不算是裸露！

75
00:05:34,860 --> 00:05:37,800
- Hey, Joey. - Hey.
-嘿，喬伊 -嘿

76
00:05:38,030 --> 00:05:41,730
Listen, I need to know that what I'm about to ask you..
聽著，我需要你保證 我接下來要問你的事…

77
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:45,460
will never get back to Chandler.
不會被錢德知道

78
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:52,380
I'd be lying if I said I hadn't thought about it myself.
如果說我沒有想過那件事 我就是在說謊

79
00:05:54,050 --> 00:05:58,110
But Chandler is my best friend. It would be wrong.
但是錢德是我最好的朋友 那是不對的

80
00:05:58,290 --> 00:06:01,380
Good, but wrong.
感覺不錯，卻是不對的

81
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:06,120
Okay, first of all, it would be great.
好的，首先，感覺會是棒透了

82
00:06:06,290 --> 00:06:09,700
But that's not what I'm here to talk to you about. I need to borrow money.
但那不是我在想的事 我需要跟你借錢

83
00:06:09,900 --> 00:06:13,090
Oh, I don't know, Monica. You know..
喔，我不知道，摩妮卡，你知道的

84
00:06:13,270 --> 00:06:15,290
lending friends money is always a mistake.
借錢給朋友不是什麼好事

85
00:06:15,470 --> 00:06:19,740
- But Chandler lent you money. - And he would tell you it was a mistake.
-但是錢德借過你錢啊 -而他也會告訴你，那不是什麼好事

86
00:06:19,910 --> 00:06:23,500
Come on, I just.. I need it for some rent and some other bills.
別這樣，我只是… 我需要付房租跟一些帳單

87
00:06:25,610 --> 00:06:26,810
Well, how much?
多少錢呢？

88
00:06:26,980 --> 00:06:29,810
- Two thousand dollars? - Two thousand dollars?
-兩千塊 -兩千塊？

89
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:33,610
What do you think I am, a soap opera star?
你以為我是誰？肥皂劇明星嗎？

90
00:06:33,790 --> 00:06:36,480
- Yeah. - That's right, I am.
-是啊 -沒錯，我就是

91
00:06:36,990 --> 00:06:38,960
Promise me you'll never tell Chandler.
答應我，你不會告訴錢德

92
00:06:39,290 --> 00:06:41,350
It'll really hurt his pride.
這真的會很傷他的自尊心

93
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,690
Chandler? Pride?
錢德？自尊心？

94
00:06:43,870 --> 00:06:46,960
I know, he thinks he has it. It's really cute.
我知道，他還以為他有 真的是很可愛

95
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,330
- Hi, you guys. - Hey.
-嗨，你們好 -嘿

96
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:53,840
- What's in the bag? - You know how Emma started crawling?
-袋子裡面是什麼？ -你們都知道艾□已經開始會爬了

97
00:06:54,010 --> 00:06:57,970
I realized that this place is very unsafe for a baby..
我發現這地方對嬰兒而言 是很不安全的

98
00:06:58,150 --> 00:07:02,080
so I went to the store and I got some stuff to baby-proof the apartment.
所以我去店裡買了一些東西 來讓公寓更適合嬰兒活動

99
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:04,270
Oh, God, baby-proofing.
喔，天啊，適合嬰兒

100
00:07:04,490 --> 00:07:07,940
Why is it such a big deal now? You know, when I was a kid, it was like:
有什麼了不起的呢？ 我小的時候，常常都…

101
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:11,350
"Whoops, Joey fell down the stairs."
「哇，喬伊跌下樓梯了」

102
00:07:11,530 --> 00:07:15,690
Or, "Whoops, Joey electrocuted himself again."
或是「哇，喬伊又電到自己了」

103
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:20,500
Anyway, are you going to get a handyman to install this stuff?
你要找人幫忙安裝這些東西嗎？

104
00:07:20,670 --> 00:07:24,160
No, I was just gonna do it myself.
不，我自己來就行了

105
00:07:26,470 --> 00:07:29,310
- You're gonna do it? - Yeah. Why?
-你要自己來？ -是啊，不行嗎？

106
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:34,240
- You don't think a woman can do this? - Women can. You can't.
-你覺得女人不可能自己做嗎？ -女人可以，你不行

107
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:39,540
Monica, will you please tell Joey that he is a pig.
摩妮卡，可以請你告訴喬伊 他是豬嗎？

108
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:43,490
- You're a pig. And you can't do this. - What?
-你是豬，而你不會做 -什麼？

109
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:47,190
What? Come on, I found the hardware store all by myself.
別這樣，我自己找到五金店的

110
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:49,230
The store's right down the street.
那間店就在街尾

111
00:07:49,430 --> 00:07:52,990
There is a hardware store right down the street?
街尾就有一間五金店嗎？

112
00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:58,730
Hey, you guys? Okay, we've got great news.
嘿，各位，我們有好消息要宣佈

113
00:07:58,910 --> 00:08:02,340
- Phoebe and I are moving in together. - Congratulations.
-菲比跟我要同居了 -恭喜了

114
00:08:02,510 --> 00:08:06,040
I know, it's so exciting. You know, I've never lived with a guy before.
我知道，好興奮 我從來都沒有跟男生同居過

115
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:10,180
Well, it's just like living with a girl, only they don't steal your makeup.
嗯，那就像跟女生一起住一樣 只是他們不會偷用你的化妝品

116
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:13,750
Unless they're playing "This Is What My Sister Would Look Like."
除非他們是在玩 「我妹妹就是長這樣」

117
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:17,210
Yeah, she's not so cute.
是啊，她不太可愛

118
00:08:17,860 --> 00:08:21,090
- I'm gonna go to the bathroom. - Well, you put down the toilet seat.
-我要上洗手間 -上完把馬桶坐墊放下來

119
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:23,260
Yes, dear.
是的，親愛的

120
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:27,700
- Is that a bit you guys do? - Uh-huh. We're playing you two.
-那是你們在玩的遊戲嗎？ -是啊，我們在模仿你們倆個

121
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:33,270
We don't do that. Tell her we don't do that.
我們沒有那樣，告訴她我們沒有

122
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:36,670
Yes, dear.
我們有，親愛的

123
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:40,180
I can't believe you're moving in together. I'm happy for you guys.
不敢相信你們要同居了 我真替你們高興

124
00:08:40,350 --> 00:08:43,550
I mean, he's a great catch. And those eyes..
我是說，他是個好對像 而且那一雙眼睛…

125
00:08:45,250 --> 00:08:48,280
I'm a scientist. I observe.
我是科學家，我會觀察

126
00:08:49,490 --> 00:08:53,020
Gosh, this is so exciting! You guys are really moving along.
天啊，這真是太令人興奮了！ 你們真是交往的太順利了

127
00:08:53,190 --> 00:08:56,100
- I hear wedding bells. - Monica, slow down, okay?
-我聽到婚禮進行曲了 -摩妮卡，別急好嗎？

128
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:58,930
I'm just excited to be living with him.
我只是很興奮要跟他一起住而已

129
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:01,090
You know, I mean, I don't know..
你知道的，我是說，我不知道…

130
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:04,670
can I see someday being married to Mike? Sure. Yeah.
我能預見有天跟麥克結婚嗎？ 是的，當然

131
00:09:04,870 --> 00:09:08,310
I could picture myself walking down the aisle in a wedding dress..
我可以想像自己 穿著婚紗走在紅毯上

132
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:11,970
that highlights my breasts in an obvious yet classy way.
婚紗以很明顯、但高雅的方式 集中突出我的胸部

133
00:09:13,980 --> 00:09:16,950
But do I want that house in Connecticut near the good schools..
但問我想不想要在康乃狄克州 有好學區的房子…

134
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:21,780
where Mike and I could send little Sophie and Mike Jr.?
讓麥克跟我送我們的 小蘇菲跟小麥克去上學？

135
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,650
Oh, my God, I do.
喔，我的天，我好想

136
00:09:24,330 --> 00:09:28,820
- I had no idea you were so conventional. - I know. I guess I am.
-我不曉得你是這麼傳統的人 -我想我是的

137
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:32,660
Oh, my God, load up the Volvo, I want to be a soccer mom.
我的天，開著富豪汽車 大包小包載孩子去練足球

138
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:37,440
- You ready to go? - Yeah, you bet, roomie.
-你準備好要走了嗎？ -當然好囉，新室友

139
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:40,900
Don't you mean "groomie"?
你是說「新郎」吧

140
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:45,610
Honey, leave the terrible jokes to me.
親愛的，把爛笑話留給我吧

141
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:48,070
- What are you talking about? - Please.
-你在說什麼？ -拜託

